'''Heavenly Hippoe''' (天使カバちゃん ''Tenshi Kaba-chan'', lit. "'''Angel Hippo-chan'''") is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Hippoe]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]], [[The Aku Realms]], and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. He was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]].

