==Trivia==
*The line about him being the next best thing to a Pegasus isn't far off: the word ''hippopotamus'' is derived from the Ancient Greek term ἱπποπόταμος (hippopótamos), meaning "river horse".
*Despite being introduced before [[Gabriel]], he is listed after him in the Enemy Guide.

